{"id":"n26745-1-7","stage":5,"title":"거뜬하다 · 轻","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n26745-1-7-1","ko":"이 일을 혼자서 다 할 수 있겠어요?","zh":"你一个人能做完所有的工作吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这，这个","explanation":"이：这，这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71687","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"혼자서","meaning":"独自，单独","explanation":"혼자：独自，单独；서：接在人数表达等后，强调这些人是动作的主体，如 혼자서（独自）。","readings":[{"term":"혼자","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30207","senseId":"1","lemma":"혼자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수","meaning":"可以，可能","explanation":"수：可以，可能","readings":[{"term":"수","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15615","senseId":"1","lemma":"수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있겠어요?","meaning":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","explanation":"있다：能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"5","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这，这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"71687","definition":"用于指示与话者离得近的物品，或用于指示话者所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"9d309cd460ea409c","term":"혼자","zh":"独自，单独","audio":"/audio/9d309cd460ea409c50fb.mp3","entryId":"30207","definition":"只有一人，没有别人。","pronunciation":["혼자"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"dcd19f5b5caac977","term":"수","zh":"可以，可能","audio":"/audio/dcd19f5b5caac9771378.mp3","entryId":"15615","definition":"做某事的能力，或某事发生的可能性。","pronunciation":["수"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"能、可以（-ㄹ/을 수 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/dd4b49eaf6c9c662ba9c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n26745-1-7-2","ko":"이 정도는 거뜬하게 해치우고도 남죠.","zh":"这点工作对我来说轻松多了，根本绰绰有余。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这","explanation":"이：这","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"2","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정도는","meaning":"程度","explanation":"정도：程度；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"1","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거뜬하게","meaning":"轻，轻便","explanation":"거뜬하다：轻，轻便；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"거뜬하다","audio":"/audio/1206626587969791408b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26745","senseId":"1","lemma":"거뜬하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해치우고도","meaning":"完结，干完","explanation":"해치우다：完结，干完；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"해치우다","audio":"/audio/52a57ce5f7d1149b6603.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85003","senseId":"1","lemma":"해치우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남죠.","meaning":"有余，足可以，完全能","explanation":"남다：有余，足可以，完全能；죠：礼貌地确认、提醒或表达意愿；죠 是 지요 的缩略。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"8","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"程度","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"表现事物的性质或价值好坏或多少的程度的分量或水准。","pronunciation":["정도"]},{"id":"1206626587969791","term":"거뜬하다","zh":"轻，轻便","audio":"/audio/1206626587969791408b.mp3","entryId":"26745","definition":"操作起来简便容易。","pronunciation":["거뜬하다"]},{"id":"52a57ce5f7d1149b","term":"해치우다","zh":"完结，干完","audio":"/audio/52a57ce5f7d1149b6603.mp3","entryId":"85003","definition":"把事情正确、爽快地完成。","pronunciation":["해ː치우다"]},{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"有余，足可以，完全能","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"超出一定程度。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/d3f55dcdd5680dab6392.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.356,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26745","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":161,"sequenceScore":3.1827,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这点工作对我来说轻松多了，根本绰绰有余。","你一个人能做完所有的工作吗？","敏俊真的非常积极开朗。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你一个人能做完所有的工作吗？","敏俊真的非常积极开朗。","这点工作对我来说轻松多了，根本绰绰有余。"],"answer":2}]}
